  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "chapter-1",
      "name": {
        "es": "Antes de partir",
        "en": "Before leaving"
      },
      "atmosphere": {
        "water": 0.12,
        "wind": 0.045,
        "birds": 0.022,
        "village": 0.009,
        "music": 0.016
      },
      "media": {
        "type": "animation",
        "videoSrc": null
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "line-1",
          "text": {
            "es": "La cascada seguía su curso, como cada mañana. El agua caía entre las rocas y se deshacía en espuma.",
            "en": "The waterfall followed its course, as it did every morning. Water fell between the rocks and dissolved into foam."
          },
          "kind": "narration"
        },
        {
          "type": "action",
          "id": "to-the-crossroads",
          "duration": 2400,
          "effects": {
            "actors": {
              "ines": {
                "x": 900,
                "y": 585,
                "pose": "walk",
                "facing": "left"
              },
              "teo": {
                "facing": "right"
              }
            },
            "view": "arrival"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "line-2",
          "text": {
            "es": "¡Nico! Espera. Se te olvida una cosa.",
            "en": "Nico! Wait. You forgot something."
          },
          "who": "ines"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "line-3",
          "text": {
            "es": "Creía que ya nos habíamos despedido. Si seguimos así, no voy a salir nunca.",
            "en": "I thought we had already said goodbye. If we keep this up, I’ll never leave."
          },
          "who": "teo"
        },
        {
          "type": "action",
          "id": "meet-at-crossroads",
          "duration": 1900,
          "effects": {
            "actors": {
              "ines": {
                "x": 852,
                "y": 592,
                "pose": "walk",
                "facing": "left"
              }
            },
            "view": "close"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "line-4",
          "text": {
            "es": "Lina se acercó con una carta pequeña. El sobre llevaba un sello rojo.",
            "en": "Lina approached with a little letter. The envelope had a red seal."
          },
          "kind": "narration"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "line-5",
          "text": {
            "es": "La hice esta mañana. Quería dártela antes de que salieras.",
            "en": "I made it this morning. I wanted to give it to you before you left."
          },
          "who": "ines"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "line-6",
          "text": {
            "es": "¿Una carta de despedida?",
            "en": "A goodbye letter?"
          },
          "who": "teo"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "line-7",
          "text": {
            "es": "Todavía no.",
            "en": "Not yet."
          },
          "who": "ines"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "chapter-2",
      "name": {
        "es": "Una carta pendiente",
        "en": "A letter to come"
      },
      "atmosphere": {
        "water": 0.065,
        "wind": 0.035,
        "birds": 0.012,
        "village": 0.006,
        "music": 0.022
      },
      "media": {
        "type": "animation",
        "videoSrc": null
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "type": "action",
          "id": "step-closer",
          "duration": 750,
          "effects": {
            "chapter": 1,
            "actors": {
              "ines": {
                "x": 822,
                "y": 615,
                "pose": "walk",
                "facing": "left"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "action",
          "id": "offer-letter",
          "duration": 1200,
          "effects": {
            "view": "letter",
            "actors": {
              "ines": {
                "pose": "reach",
                "facing": "left"
              },
              "teo": {
                "pose": "reach",
                "facing": "right"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "action",
          "id": "receive-letter",
          "duration": 1300,
          "effects": {
            "lamp": {
              "owner": "teo"
            },
            "actors": {
              "ines": {
                "pose": "reach"
              },
              "teo": {
                "pose": "reach"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "line-8",
          "text": {
            "es": "Lina le tendió el sobre. Nico lo recibió con cuidado, como si dentro hubiera algo que pudiera romperse.",
            "en": "Lina held out the envelope. Nico took it carefully, as if there were something fragile inside."
          },
          "kind": "narration"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "line-9",
          "text": {
            "es": "Pesa muy poco.",
            "en": "It feels very light."
          },
          "who": "teo"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "line-10",
          "text": {
            "es": "Está vacío.",
            "en": "It’s empty."
          },
          "who": "ines"
        },
        {
          "type": "action",
          "id": "small-smile",
          "duration": 600,
          "effects": {
            "actors": {
              "teo": {
                "pose": "smile"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "line-11",
          "text": {
            "es": "Eso explica lo de «todavía».",
            "en": "That explains the “not yet.”"
          },
          "who": "teo"
        },
        {
          "type": "action",
          "id": "return-to-conversation",
          "duration": 1100,
          "effects": {
            "view": "close"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "line-12",
          "text": {
            "es": "Quiero que me escribas cuando llegues. Una sola cosa. Algo que aquí no tengamos.",
            "en": "I want you to write when you arrive. Just one thing. Something we don’t have here."
          },
          "who": "ines"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "line-13",
          "text": {
            "es": "¿Y si no encuentro nada que valga la pena contar?",
            "en": "What if I don’t find anything worth telling you?"
          },
          "who": "teo"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "line-14",
          "text": {
            "es": "Puede ser algo pequeño. Lo primero que te haga sonreír al llegar.",
            "en": "It can be something small. The first thing that makes you smile when you arrive."
          },
          "who": "ines"
        },
        {
          "type": "action",
          "id": "read-the-seal",
          "duration": 1300,
          "effects": {
            "view": "letter",
            "actors": {
              "teo": {
                "pose": "down"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "mood": "down",
          "type": "text",
          "id": "line-15",
          "text": {
            "es": "Nico bajó la mirada hacia el sobre. Por primera vez, el viaje parecía tener un tamaño que cabía en sus manos.",
            "en": "Nico looked down at the envelope. For the first time, the journey seemed small enough to fit in his hands."
          },
          "kind": "narration"
        },
        {
          "type": "action",
          "id": "look-up",
          "duration": 1100,
          "effects": {
            "view": "close"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "line-16",
          "text": {
            "es": "¿Y tú qué vas a hacer mientras?",
            "en": "And what will you do in the meantime?"
          },
          "who": "teo"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "line-17",
          "text": {
            "es": "Esperar la carta. Y aprender a hacer pan sin quemarlo. Las dos cosas pueden llevar tiempo.",
            "en": "Wait for your letter. And learn to bake bread without burning it. Both might take a while."
          },
          "who": "ines"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "chapter-3",
      "name": {
        "es": "El primer paso",
        "en": "The first step"
      },
      "atmosphere": {
        "water": 0.085,
        "wind": 0.055,
        "birds": 0.025,
        "village": 0.008,
        "music": 0.019
      },
      "media": {
        "type": "animation",
        "videoSrc": null
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "type": "action",
          "id": "look-to-path",
          "duration": 1100,
          "effects": {
            "chapter": 2,
            "view": "path",
            "actors": {
              "teo": {
                "facing": "back"
              },
              "ines": {
                "facing": "back"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "line-18",
          "text": {
            "es": "Los dos miraron el sendero que se alejaba del cruce. Esta vez, Nico no apartó la vista.",
            "en": "They both looked at the path leading away from the crossroads. This time, Nico didn’t look away."
          },
          "kind": "narration"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "line-19",
          "text": {
            "es": "Entonces te escribiré sobre la primera panadería. Para que compares.",
            "en": "Then I’ll write about the first bakery. So you can compare."
          },
          "who": "teo"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "line-20",
          "text": {
            "es": "Trato hecho.",
            "en": "It’s a deal."
          },
          "who": "ines"
        },
        {
          "type": "action",
          "id": "first-step",
          "duration": 1800,
          "effects": {
            "view": "departure",
            "actors": {
              "teo": {
                "x": 740,
                "y": 484,
                "pose": "walk",
                "facing": "back"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "action",
          "id": "keep-walking",
          "duration": 1600,
          "effects": {
            "actors": {
              "teo": {
                "x": 730,
                "y": 395,
                "pose": "walk",
                "facing": "back"
              },
              "ines": {
                "pose": "reach",
                "facing": "left"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "line-21",
          "text": {
            "es": "Nico dio el primer paso, y luego otro. Lina se quedó junto al cruce. En las manos de Nico, aquel sobre vacío ya llevaba una promesa.",
            "en": "Nico took one step, then another. Lina stayed by the crossroads. In his hands, the empty envelope already held a promise."
          },
          "kind": "narration"
        },
        {
          "type": "end",
          "id": "end"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
